# ===== Symfony Task Manager Web App =====

## 📌 Objective
Build a simple Task Manager Web Application using:

- Symfony (Latest Version)
- Doctrine ORM (Database)
- Twig (Templating Engine)
- TailwindCSS (Styling)

---

## 🚀 Features

### 1. Task Entity
The application includes a `Task` entity with the following fields:

- `id` (Primary Key)
- `title` (String, Required)
- `description` (String, Optional)
- `status` (Enum/String: `pending`, `in_progress`, `done`)
- `created_at` (DateTime)

---

### 2. CRUD Functionality

#### ➕ Create Task
- Add new task form
- Validation for required fields (title, status)

#### 📄 Read Task
- Display all tasks in a table
- Columns:
  - Title
  - Description
  - Status
  - Created Date
  - Actions (Edit / Delete)

#### ✏️ Update Task
- Edit form with pre-filled task data

#### ❌ Delete Task
- Delete button with confirmation prompt

---

### 3. UI Design (TailwindCSS)

- Responsive table layout
- Styled buttons:
  - Add Task (Blue / Primary)
  - Edit (Yellow)
  - Delete (Red)
- Form styling with spacing and borders
- Status badges:
  - 🟡 Pending → Gray
  - 🟠 In Progress → Yellow
  - 🟢 Done → Green

---

## 🛠 Installation & Setup

### 1. Clone Repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/task-manager.git
cd task-manager